## How to Use This File

This is the central source of truth for all job applications. Read this when:

- Starting work on any application ("where did I leave off?")
- Deciding what to work on next
- Checking status across all active applications

Claude will propose updates here at the end of each session. You approve or reject — never auto-applied.

